'''Green Luger''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that was originally obtainable by [[crafting]] a [[Luger]] [[File:LugerUpdated.png|25px|link=Luger]] and 75 [[Gifts 2015|Gifts]] {{Currency|Gift2015}} together during the [[Christmas Event 2015|2015 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
It resembles a metallic green in color luger pistol, hence the name. However, the toggle pin and the grip of the handle are slightly darker in color.

==Trivia ==
*There was a 51% Chance of crafting the Green Luger and a 49% chance of crafting its counterpart, [[Red Luger]].
*To craft this, players needed a [[Luger]] and 75 [[Gifts 2015|gifts]].
*This is one of the reskins of [[Luger]]. The others are [[Lugercane]], [[Ginger Luger]], [[Red Luger]], and [[Chroma Luger]].
*This and [[Red Luger]] are the first reskins of Luger released in MM2.
* Its model derives from the Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/95354288/Luger-Pistol Luger Pistol], purchasable from the avatar shop for 700 Robux. However, the texture has been altered to a different color scheme. 

